t and Stardust missions. He was also the chief engineer for the Galileo project from 1977-1988 and director of science analysis and mission planning during the Viking projects. As an author he is best known for co-writing, with Arthur C. Clarke, the books Cradle in 1989, Rama II in 1989, The Garden of Rama in 1991 and Rama Revealed in 1993. He collaborated with Carl Sagan on the 1980 series Cosmos. Lee went on to write three more science fiction novels after Rama Revealed. Two take place in the Rama universe (Bright Messengers, Double Full Moon Night) while one makes several references to it (Tranquility Wars))uhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gentry_Lee  aISFDb, Aug. 20, 2018b(Author: Gentry Lee; Legal Name: Bert Gentry Lee; Birthplace: New York City, New York, USA; Birthdate: 29 March 1942)uhttp://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/ea.cgi?233801125cz  a2200217n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075035002300092040003700115100006600152400005300218400005300271400005700324400004700381400004700428400007500475667004700550670031000597n  87936234 DLC20180822073433.0880209nc azannaabn          |b aaa        an  87936234   a(OCoLC)oca02199703  aDLCbengerdacDLCdOCoLCdHkUST1 aYang, Yinshen,d1908-1989.tRi chang shi wu zhang gu cong shu1 a杨荫深,d1908-1989.t日常事物掌故丛书1 a楊蔭深,d1908-1989.t日常事物掌故叢書1 aYang, Yinshen,d1908-1989.tShi wu zhang gu cong tan1 a杨荫深,d1908-1989.t事物掌故丛谈1 a楊蔭深,d1908-1989.t事物掌故叢談1 wnneaaYang, Yin-shen,d1898-tJih chʻang shih wu chang ku tsʻung shu  aNon-Latin script references not evaluated.  aShi wu zhang gu cong tan, 1986: $b t.p. (事物掌故丛谈 = Shi wu zhang gu cong tan) cover (事物掌故叢談 = Shi wu zhang gu cong tan) reprint note (orig. title: 日常事物掌故丛书 = Ri chang shi wu zhang gu cong shu) orig. pref. (日常事物掌故叢書 = Ri chang shi wu zhang gu cong shu)00717cz  a2200157n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075035002300092040003800115100002400153400003500177670013300212670021400345n  87941