6070 aReginald McKnight is an African American writer.00548cz  a2200181n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075035002300092040003000115100001600145400002400161400001400185667005600199667004700255670006400302n  87943533 DLC20180822073557.0871123nc acannaabn          |b aaa        an  87943533   a(OCoLC)oca01986789  aDLCbengcDLCdOCoLCdNIC1 aHu, Youqing1 wnneaHu, Yu-chʻing1 a胡幼青  aMachine-derived non-Latin script reference project.  aNon-Latin script references not evaluated.  aKʻai tʻo hsing ti chʻi yeh, 1986:bpref. (Hu Yu-chʻing)00635cz  a2200169n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075035002300092040004500115100001800160375001700178500002100195670011500216670013400331n  87948758 DLC20180822073405.0880108n| azannaabn          |a aaa        an  87948758   a(OCoLC)oca02191676  aDLCbengerdacDLCdIeDuTCdDLCdMdRoLAC1 aMoran, Gerard  aMales2lcdgt1 aMoran, Gerard P.  aHis The Mayo evictions of 1860, 1986:bt.p. (Gerard P. Moran) p. 4 of cover (Gerard P. Moran, M.A., H.Dip.Ed.)  aHis Sending out Ireland's poor, 2004 :bt.p. (Gerard Moran) jkt. (coordinator of History at the European School, Uccle, Brussels)01082cz  a2200229n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075035002300092040003600115046002100151100005400172373005200226374002300278377000800301670006800309670006800377670006200445670014000507670020500647n  88002994 DLC20180822073430.0880627n| azannaabn          |n aaa     c  an  88002994   a(OCoLC)oca02309259  aMoSU-LbengerdacDLCdDLCdCSt  f1890g19612edtf1 aSears, Kenneth C.q(Kenneth Craddock),d1890-1961  aUniversity of ChicagoaStanford University2naf  aLaw teachers2lcsh  aeng  aHis Methods of reapportionment, c1952:bt.p. (Kenneth C. Sears)  aOCLC data base, 6-9-88b(hdg.: Sears, Kenneth Craddock, 1890- )  aBGMI, May 21, 2009b(Sears, Kenneth Craddock (1890-1961))  aStanford historical photograph