er serial killer. Between 1971-1983 murdered at least 17 people in and around Anchorage, Alaska. Arrested in 1983, sentenced to 461 years and a life sentence; died at Alaska Regional Hospital in Anchorage August 21, 2014 due to undisclosed lingering health conditions)  https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_Hansen  aAllthatsinteresting.com, July 31, 2018:bRobert Hansen (an avid hunter who set several local hunting records ) https://allthatsinteresting.com/robert-hansen  aThe Washington Post, July 31, 2018:bRobert Hansen (Convicted serial killer Robert Hansen, who abducted women and hunted them down in the Alaska wilderness in the 1970s as Anchorage boomed with construction of the trans-Alaska oil pipeline, died Aug. 21 at a hospital in Anchorage. He was 75.Mr. Hansen, who got the nickname “the Butcher Baker,” owned a bakery in a downtown mini-mall in the 1970s and 1980s.)  https://www.washingtonpost.com/national/robert-hansen-dies-at-75-convicted-alaska-serial-killer/2014/08/22/cf2d2acc-2989-11e4-86ca-6f03cbd15c1a_story.html?noredirect=on&utm_term=.fcaa2768fe5901420cz  a2200217n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010004500075040002800120110003000148410003200178410004100210510003400251670011800285670014200403670013400545670018500679670012100864670021700985n  94063560 DLC20180822144317.0940701n| azannaabn          |a ana        an  94063560 zn 2006044132zn 2015067918  aDLCbengerdacDLCdDLC2 aAtlantic Publishing Group2 aAtlantic Publishing Company2 wnneaAtlantic Publishing Group, Inc.2 aAtlantic Communications Group  aIts Map of Wilkes-Barre, Pennsylvania, 1994:bmap recto (The Atlantic Publishing Group, Inc., Ft. Washington, PA)  aPhone call to the Group, 5 Apr. 2001b(Name changed from Atlantic Publishing Group to Atlantic Communications Group at beginning of 2001)  aThe first-time homeowner's handbook, c2006:becip t.p. (Atlantic Publishing Company) verso t.p. (Atlantic Publishing Group, Inc.)  aEmail from publis