4943  aDLCbengerdacDLCdOCoLCdMH-MudDLCdOCoLC1 aSalomon, Charlotte,d1917-1943.tLeben oder Theater  aLeben oder Theater? 1986.  aWikipedia, viewed Apr. 4, 2007b(Charlotte Salomon entrusted more than 1,000 gouaches to a friend. These included her autobiographical series of paintings Life? or Theater? (Leben? oder Theater?) consisting of 769 paintings painted between 1940 and 1942.   Leben? oder Theater? is not only a series of paintings; it includes a script in the form of words that are either themselves in the form of paintings, written into the paintings, or presented as overlays to the images. It also has a 'soundtrack' - music chosen by Charlotte that reinforces her stories; only exhibited since the 1960's; there have been  exhibitions of parts of Life? or Theater?)  aAnswers.com, viewed Apr. 4, 2007b(Charlotte Salomon (1917-1943), a young German artist, painted her autobiography in the midst of World War II; Salomon's work: "Life or Theater?: An Operetta" unfolds in 1,350 paintings of astonishing vividness and force; after 1980, it achieved international renown through publications, film, drama, and popular exhibits in Amsterdam, Berkeley, Los Angeles, Miami, Tel Aviv, Berlin, etc.)00491cz  a2200157n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075040002800092100002300120375001100143377001300154670010200167670006400269n 2007024523DLC20180824133216.0070406n| azannaabn          |n aaa        an 2007024523  aDLCbengerdacDLCdSLC1 aPashtoon, Zeeya A.  afemale  apasaeng  aPashtoon, Naseer Hoonar. A handbook of Pashto verbal conjugation, 2006:bt.p. (Zeeya A. Pashtoon)  aPashto-English Dictionary, 2009 :bt.p. (Zeeya A. Pashtoon)00684cz  a2200169n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075035002300092040003700115100001700152667013800169667006900307670004400376670009400420n 2007027232DLC20180822073424.0070418n| acannaabn          |n aba        an 2007027232  a(OCoLC)oca0738743