ii (1946); editor of the works of Jaroslav Hašek)  aLexikon české literatury, 1985:bVolume 1, page 63 (Zdena Ančík; real name: Zdeněk Ančík; born 10 January 1900 in Kunovice (Uherské Hradiště-Kunovice; died 17 September 1972 in Prague; journalst, author of humorous prose, poet)  aScvrk se nám Cvrk, 1944:btitle page (ZA)00727cz  a2200217n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075035002300092040003300115046002100148053001700169100002700186370002300213374001800236375001100254377000800265670006400273670017200337no2006078345DLC20180822073535.0060711n| azannaabn          |n aaa     c  ano2006078345  a(OCoLC)oca07007198  aNjPbengerdacNjPdDLCdInU  f1971-06-182edtf 0aPQ4902.A73351 aBarbato, Paola,d1971-  aMilan (Italy)2naf  aAuthors2lcsh  afemale  afre  aBilico, 2006:bt.p. (Paola Barbato) jkt. (b. 1971 in Milan)  aWikipedia, 21 August 2018b(Paola Barbato (born 18 June 1971) is an Italian writer of comics and novels; born in Milan; involved in social activities and philanthropy)00354cz  a2200133n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075035002300092040002800115100002200143670005500165no2006082882DLC20180827112922.0060809n| azannaabn          |n aaa     c  ano2006082882  a(OCoLC)oca07018069  aICUbengerdacICUdDLC1 aAudéon, Hervé  aLe trio avec piano, 2005:bt.p. (Hervé Audéon)01427cz  a2200313n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075035002300092040003500115046002100150100003800171370003100209374001700240375001900257377000800276378002500284400004500309400003200354400003200386400002900418400004500447667005600492667004600548670010400594670015000698670026500848no2006084272DLC20180823073259.0060814n| azannaabn          |b aaa     c  ano2006084272  a(OCoLC)oca07021630  aWaUbengerdacWaUdOCoLCdNjP  f1937-01-132edtf1 aShengelai︠a︡, Ariadna,d1937-  aTashkent (Uzbekistan)2naf  aActors2lcsh  aFemales2lcd