s-koti.html02803cz  a2200253n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075035002300092040004500115046002100160110003400181370002400215410004400239410004400283510004300327667028800370670005900658670010200717670057800819670056101397670059101958no2011038640DLC20180824073348.0110310n| azannaabn          |a ana     c  ano2011038640  a(OCoLC)oca08793405  aGUbengerdacGUdDLCdCSmHdDLCdGUdHU  s1733-02-122edtf2 aChrist Church (Savannah, Ga.)  eSavannah (Ga.)2naf2 aChrist Church Episcopal (Savannah, Ga.)2 aChrist Episcopal Church (Savannah, Ga.)2 aChrist Church Anglican (Savannah, Ga.)  aUse for the Episcopal church. In September 2007 a split resulted in two congregations claiming the name Christ Church, Savannah; for the Anglican branch that continued using the name and the historic church building until ca. December 2011, see Christ Church Anglican (Savannah, Ga.)  aSamson's riddle, 1863:bt.p. (Christ Church, Savannah)  aFrom Savannah kitchens, 196? :bt.p. (Christ Church, Savannah, Georgia ; Christ Episcopal Church)  aChrist Church Episcopal, Savannah Georgia website, searched April 13, 2016:bTimeline (Historic Christ Church Episcopal is a member of the Diocese of Georgia and The Episcopal Church; founded on February 12, 1733. In 2007 Sept. 30, the rector, vestry and several members of Christ Church dissaffiliate from the Episcopal Church and align with the Church of Uganda, they later establish themselves as Christ Church Anglican)uhttp://www.christchurchsavannah.org/main/about-christ-church/history-2/history/.christchurchsavannah.org/main/about-christ-church/history-2/history/  aChrist Church Episcopal website, June 12, 2018:b(Christ Church Episcopal ; Christ Church) timeline (2011: On November 21, the Georgia Supreme Court rules 6-1 that all real and personal property of Christ Church is held in trust for the Episcopal Church and the Diocese of Georgia as provided for in the Constitution and Canons of the Church and the Diocese. On December 18, the Fourth Sunday of Advent, the Episcopalians hold their first service in Christ Church since being forced to leave on September 30, 2007)uhttp://christchurchsavannah.org/history/  aSavannah Morning News, June 12, 2018:barticle Christ Church case settles, ending almost five-year discord, posted May 3, 2012 (the Episcopal Diocese of Georgia, and Christ Church Episcopal, will retain...the exclusive right to use the designations of "Christ Church, Savannah," and "the Mother Church of Georgia"; the Anglican congregation that separated from the Episcopal Church during the litigation will re-incorporate as "Christ Church Anglican"; The settlement also specifically allows both groups to trace their heritage to the 1733 founding of an Anglican mission in Savannah.)01904cz  a2200397n  no2011048070DLC20180823073341.0110325n| azannaabn          |b aaa     c  ano2011048070  a(OCoLC)oca08809572  aIlMchBWIbengerdacIlMchBWIdDLCdInUdHkUST  f1953-052edtf1 aDuobuji  aCona Xian (China)2naf  aMotion picturesaTelevisionaActing2lcsh  aShanghai xi ju xue yuan. Biao yan xi  aZhongguo xi ju jia xie hui2naf  aZhongguo ying shi yi shu xie hui  aActors2lcdgt  aMales2lcdgt  achi1 aDuo-bu-ji1 a多布吉1 aDuobujie1 aDuo Bu Jie1 a多布杰1 aDobrgyal  aNon-Latin script references not evaluated.  aHong he gu [VR] c2003:btitle frame (多布吉 = Duobuji, cast)  aIMDb, Mar. 16, 2011b(Duobuji; actor)  aSensasian website, Mar. 25, 2011b(Duo Bu Ji; Duo Bu Jie)  aHello Kids website, Mar. 25, 2011b(SURNAME : DUOBUJI)  aOCLC, Mar. 25, 2011b(Duo-bu-ji; Duobujie = 多布杰)  aBai du bai ke WWW site, Aug. 21, 2018b(多布杰 = Duobujie; b. May 1953, Xizang Shannan Cuona Xian Kada Xiang; film and television actor of mainland China; grad., Shanghai xi ju xue yuan biao yan xi; starred in the film Hong he gu, 1996)uhttps://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%A4%9A%E5%B8%83%E6%9D%B0/8998944  aYOUKU WWW site, Aug. 22, 2018b(多布