portation.01269cz  a2200265n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010003100075035002300106040004500129046002100174100003100195370004300226374003200269375001700301377000800318400003900326400003600365670010100401670006600502670006300568670019400631670017800825no2012032364DLC20180823100132.0120305n| azannaabn          |a aaa     c  ano2012032364zn 2012070001  a(OCoLC)oca09134447  aIlMchBWIbengerdacIlMchBWIdICrlFdDLC  f1966-01-162edtf1 aDesprés, Jacques,d1966-  aSuresnes (France)eParis (France)2naf  aArtistsaIllustrators2lcsh  aMales2lcdgt  afre1 wnneaaDesprés, Jacquesc(Artist)1 wnneaaDesprés, Jaques,d1966-  aBrenifier, Oscar. Wo yu shi jie mian dui mian, c2009:bcolophon (Jacques Després; illustrator)  aDNB via VIAF, Mar. 5, 2012b(Hdg.: Després, Jacques, 1966-)  aThe meaning of life, 2013:bE-Cip t.p. (Jacques Després)  aLove and friendship, 2013:bE-Cip t.p. (Jacques Després) data view (illustrator of six books for children ; has worked in fields as varied as jewelry, fine art, animation, and set design)  aWikipedia, May 30, 2018b(Jacques Després, born January 16, 1966 in Suresnes, is a French illustrator. He studied at the Orleans Visual Arts Institute. He lives in Paris.)00856cz  a2200193n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075035002300092040003000115046002700145100003100172400005100203667003700254670011200291670019300403670006600596no2012033418DLC20180822082410.0120307n| azannaabn          |a aaa     c  ano2012033418  a(OCoLC)oca09136551  aPPiUbengerdacPPiUdDLC  f1935-08-02g20172edtf1 aUngureanu, Ion,d1935-20171 aUnguri︠a︡nu, Ion Spiridonovich,d1935-2017  aNot the same as: Ungureanu, Ion.  aTeatrul vieții mele ..., 2011-2012 :bv.1, t.p. (Ion Ungureanu) p. 4 of cover (b. 1935 in Opaci, Moldova)  aRomanian Wikipedia, viewed March 7, 2012:b(Ion Ungureanu; in Russian, Ion Spiridonovich Unguri︠a︡nu; b. Aug. 2, 1935; actor, direct