t the urging of President Barack Obama he was considering a run for the U.S. House of Representatives and he announced his candidacy on October 11, 2011.)00801cz  a2200229n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075035002300092040003300115130008400148380005200232430003900284430006000323642001700383643003000400644001100430645001700441646001100458670010200469no2012134208DLC20180823073302.0121011n| azaaaaaan          |a ana     c  ano2012134208  a(OCoLC)oca09322394  aNcUbengerdacNcUdICUdCLU 0aRencontres (Éditions Classiques Garnier).pSérie Le dix-huitième siècle  aSeries (Publications)aMonographic series2lcsh 0aSérie Le dix-huitième siècle 0aDix-huitième siècle (Éditions Classiques Garnier)  a35DPCC5NcU  aParisbClassiques Garnier  af5NcU  at5DPCC5NcU  as5NcU  aLe corps et l'esprit en voyage, 2012:bser. t.p. (Rencontres. Série Le dix-huitième siècle)01212cz  a2200253n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075035002300092040002800115046002100143100003000164370004300194372002400237374001800261374004700279375001700326377000800343378003100351670006200382670033600444670017800780no2012134792DLC20180823073302.0121012n| azannaabn          |n aaa     c  ano2012134792  a(OCoLC)oca09322978  aMCMbengerdacMCMdIEN  f1963-06-262edtf1 aGarfield, Richard,d1963-  aPhiladelphia (Pa.)cUnited States2naf  aGames--Design2lcsh  agame designer  aDesignersaMathematiciansaInventors2lcsh  aMales2lcdgt  aeng  qGarfield, Richard Channing  aCharacteristics of games, c2012:bt.p. (Richard Garfield)  aWikipedia, viewed Oct. 12, 2012b(Richard Channing Garfield, PhD (born June 26, 1963, Philadelphia) is a game designer who created the card games Magic: The Gathering, Netrunner, BattleTech CCG, Vampire: The Eternal Struggle (originally known as Jyhad), The Great Dalmuti, Star Wars Trading Card Game, and the board game RoboRally)  aWikipedia, viewed A