 Youth Activism Project at the University of Arizona. My research primarily contributes to our understanding of repression and threat processes, but I am broadly interested in systems of control and how they fail (i.e. how resistance emerges). I completed my PhD at Ohio State University in 2013.) CV (Thomas V. Maher, thomasvmaher@purdue.edu ; Education: Ph.D., 2013, Sociology, Ohio State University; M.A., 2007, Sociology, Ohio State University; B.A., 2005, Sociology & History, Purdue University ; Academic positions: 2013-14 Teaching Fellow, Ohio State University, Department of Sociology; 2014-15, Lecturer, Ohio State University, Department of Sociology; 2015-present, Post-Doctoral Research Scholar, Youth Activism Project, University of Arizona; 2017-present, Continuous Lecturer, Purdue University)uhttp://thomasvmaher.weebly.com/01032cz  a2200229n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075035002300092040003000115043001200145151002400157451002400181451002600205451003200231667004700263670008200310670016100392670022600553781002300779no2014020202DLC20180824143719.0140214n| azannaabn          |b ana     c  ano2014020202  a(OCoLC)oca09683248  aDHMMbengerdacDHMMdDLC  ae-un---  aRakiv Lis (Ukraine)  aRakov Les (Ukraine)  aRakovy Lyas (Ukraine)  aРаків Ліс (Ukraine)  aNon-Latin script references not evaluated.  aUS Holocaust Memorial Museum catalog, 14 February 2014b(Rakiv Lis (Ukraine))  aGEOnet, 14 February 2014b(Rakiv Lis; PPL, 51°37ʹ18ʺN, 024°55ʹ27ʺE; Volynsʹka Oblastʹ, Ukraine; variants: Раків Ліс, Rakov Les, Rakovy Lyas)  aВерховна Рада України web site, 14 February 2014b(Регіони України та їх склад: Раків Ліс, Волинська область, Камінь-Каширський район) 0zUkrainezRakiv Lis01332cz  a2200241n  450000100130000000300040001300500170001700800410003401000310007503500230010604000430012904600230017210000470019536800220024237000610026437200230032537500170034840000480036540000380041367001490045167003010060067001890