e roles as Frankenstein and Hercules, died on Monday, June 1st, in Palmdale, CA. He was 82. Born in Washington D.C on January 6, 1933, Mike was the only child of Alice and Maxwell Gorvit. Growing up, he excelled in wrestling, the sport that allowed him to find acceptance as an adult. He later changed his name from Gorvit to Lane)  a1940 United States Federal Census, via Ancestry website, Aug. 16, 2016:b(Gorvit, Maxwell, Jr., age 7 [1933]; place of birth, Washington D.C.; parents Maxwell & Alice)00591cz  a2200205n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075035002300092040002700115046000900142100002600151370004600177372000900223374001100232375000900243377000800252670012500260no2015000766DLC20180821113833.0150105n| azannaabn          |n aaa     c  ano2015000766  a(OCoLC)oca10052251  aICrlFbengerdacICrlF  f19881 aStanton, Matt,d1988-  aChicago (Ill.)eBrooklyn (New York, N.Y.)  aArts  aArtist  amale  aeng  amattstantonartist.com, Dec. 20, 2014 (born in Chicago in 1988, works in a range of mediums, lives and works in Brooklyn)01248cz  a2200253n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075035002300092040003700115046001300152100003200165370003800197374008600235375000900321400002100330400002800351510005500379510004800434670009300482670028000575670013900855no2015010242DLC20180821073532.0150123n| azannaabn          |a aaa     c  ano2015010242  a(OCoLC)oca10069123  aTxU-MubengerdacTxU-MudTxU-Mu  f197812310 aAadm Our Hatleyc(Musician)  aTemple (Tex.)cUnited States2naf  aDrummers (Musicians)aPercussionistsaGuitaristsaInstrumentalistsaSingers2lcsh  amale1 aHatley, Aadm Our1 aHatley, Adam R.,d1978-2 wricorporate body:aThose Peabodys (Musical group)2 wricorporate body:aBangaar (Musical group)  aHatley, Adam R. Blast the rim, 2014:blabel (Aadm Our Hatley) container (Adam R. Hatley)  aEmail correspondence from Adam R. Hatley, Jan. 22, 2015b(Correctly spel