-day fieldwork internship in rural France for the Formation à la Recherche en Afrique Noire program; this teaching is destined for students wishing, after their "licence" studies, to focus on research in Africa) leaf 147 (la FRAN)  aMassamba-Loussakout, Louis. La protection sociale en République populaire du Congo : mémoire (D.E.A.), 1986, viewed online August 16, 2018:bpreliminary pages (Jean-Pierre Raison, directeur d'études at EHESS, certifies that Massamba-Loussakout regularly attended his lectures on geography of rural spaces, given for the Centre d'Etudes Africaines de l'EHESS; Michel Aghassian, responsible for the cycle Formation à la Recherche en Afrique Noire (F.R.A.N.), certifies that Massamba Loussakout regularly attended his seminars, given for the Centre d'Etudes Africaines de l'EHESS; two other such testimonies not specifically mentioning "Formation à la Recherche en Afrique Noire": one on EHEESS, Centre d'Études Africaines letterhead, the other on CNRS, Laboratoire de Sociologie et Géographie Africaines (L.A. 94) letterhead but signed as being a researcher at CNRS, Centre d'Etudes Africaines)00647nz  a2200205n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075035002300092040002900115046000700144100002400151370001700175372001800192374006500210375001100275377000800286670014700294no2018110332DLC20180822073032.0180817n| azannaabn          |n aaa     c  ano2018110332  a(OCoLC)oca11504763  aIeDuTCbengerdacIeDuTC  s201 aDelahunty, Sinéad  cIreland2naf  aCooking2lcsh  aPhysical therapistsaGaelic football playersaBloggers2lcsh  afemale  aeng  aDelalicious : a full plate for a full life, 2018 :bt.p. (Sinéad Delahunty) p. 4 of cover (physiotherapist, Gaelic footballer, food blogger)01287nz  a2200205n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075035002300092040003100115100002200146370003700168372005400205373003200259375001800291377000800309400002500317670073900342no2018110333