he Year, and a B'nai Brith League of Human Rights award for the radio series "Art and the Holocaust." She is currently a producer with CBC Radio's documentary program Ideas)  aAmazon.ca, February 24, 2016:bIce cream: the delicious history (about the author: Marilyn Powell is an award-winning writer, broadcaster, and producer, best known for her work on CBC Radio's acclaimed documentary program Ideas. Her work has been published in Saturday Night, The Canadian Forum, and Books in Canada. Her short stories have appeared in Toronto Short Stories and Aurora III. Powell has a Ph.D. in English literature from Harvard University and has taught at Sarah Lawrence College in Bronxville, New York. She lives in Toronto)00627nz  a2200157n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075035002300092040003100115100002400146374005900170670006400229670017600293no2018111693DLC20180821073403.0180820n| azannaabn          |n aaa     c  ano2018111693  a(OCoLC)oca11510274  aMeLeBNMbengerdacMeLeBNM1 aHamburger, Daniël  aComposersaFilm composersaArrangers (Musicians)2lcsh  aWinnie, 2017:bcredits (Daniël Hamburger; original music)  aDaniël Hamburger WWW site, August 20, 2018b(Daniël Hamburger; composer and arranger writing for film, theater, and the concert stage)uhttp://www.danielhamburger.com/01258nz  a2200253n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075035002300092040002300115046002100138100002600159370002800185372007100213374007500284375001900359377000800378400003200386400003200418400002600450670006200476670046600538no2018111694DLC20180821073403.0180820n| azannaabn          |a aaa     c  ano2018111694  a(OCoLC)oca11510275  aUOrbengerdacUOr  f1957-11-292edtf1 aSmyth, Sharon,d1957-  aPhiladelphia (Pa.)2naf  aTelevisionaTelevision commercialsaMotion picturesaFashion2lcsh  aActorsaModels (Persons)aMotion picture producers and directors2lcsh  aFemales2lcdgt  aeng1 aLentz, Sharo